+Refuel AI Supplements V6.4.64 — WhatsApp button activates with Refuel business number
+
+The floating WhatsApp link now uses the confirmed Refuel number 923209000100 whenever the WordPress Customizer field is empty or invalid. A valid number saved under Appearance → Customize → Refuel Customer Care still overrides this fallback. This resolves the v6.4.63 case in which the button was absent even though the theme was installed. The link opens https://wa.me/923209000100 with a product-help greeting. Other v6.4.63 placement and dialog behavior is retained.
+
+Install this ZIP as a theme update. The new theme version refreshes asset URLs and the PWA shell. Checkout and account pages still omit the floating contact control.
